Services — Key Priorities

Services Global Town Hall — Q1 2026

* Growth: Increase sales intensity; Reduce Services gap to wallet.
* Partnerships: Improve partnership with Banking, Wealth, and Markets; Increase connectivity across Services.
* Technology and AI: Continue to modernize platforms and unify tools; Embed AI across the business.
* Innovation: Accelerate innovation and digital assets execution.
* Other strategic priorities: Client Experience; Risk & Control; Talent & Culture.

Business Execution Town Hall — May 2026
Related firmwide Operating Model & Artificial Intelligence (OM&AI) agenda.

* Process improvement: Identifying processes and prioritizing them for improvement based on impact on client and employee experiences, risk and controls, and expenses.
* Execution: Simplifying policies, re-engineering processes, redesigning delivery models; embedding AI and other technology enhancements.

TTS Global Client PMO Town Hall — 1H26
Selected Client PMO goals for 2026.

* Revenue realization: At least 90% of revenue live from deals won in 2025; At least 40% of revenue live from deals won in 2026.
* Client satisfaction and delivery: VoC Pulse Surveys satisfaction score >95%; “Very Satisfied” score >80%; Project Management Quality score should be at least 80%.
* Controls: ≥85% Controls Effectiveness.

